    "url": "https://corpgov.law.harvard.edu/2026/07/26/new-day-new-rules-five-key-aspects-of-amended-dgcl-section-144-and-section-220/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=new-day-new-rules-five-key-aspects-of-amended-dgcl-section-144-and-section-220",
