    "authors": "Michael Brei, Giulio Cornelli, Leonardo Gambacorta, Boris Hofmann",
    "abstract": "This paper examines the implications of two coincident digital trends – the digitalisation of banking and the widespread adoption of social media – for the pricing of deposits in the United States. Using branch-level data, we analyse how both trends interact to influence the level of deposit rates as well as their adjustment to changes in the policy rate.",
