    "authors": "Özcan Serhat Cengiz",
    "abstract": "This chapter develops a conceptual framework of “business responsibility” and situates fintech within that framework. While doing so, it integrates insights from corporate law, corporate finance, and management studies. Further, it revisits the concept of “sustainability-oriented innovation” and highlights fintech's potential to achieve the Sustainable Development Goals.",
